{
  "id": "in-home-respite",
  "term": "in-home respite",
  "definition": "In-home respite is a formal respite service in which a paid worker comes to the older person’s home and stays there to provide temporary relief from family caring duties. In the dementia care context, it is intended to give carers a short break while helping the person remain at home.",
